(1) As at the time this Act enters into force, the former Association shall amend its articles of incorporation through a resolution adopted at a general meeting thereof so that it is converted into an incorporated association under Article 32 of the Civil Act.
(2) The former Association which has amended its articles of incorporation pursuant to paragraph (1) shall file an application for permission to amend the articles of incorporation with the Minister of Trade, Industry and Energy pursuant to Article 42 of the Civil Act.
